[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7142.31, "timestamp": "01:59:02", "text": "YouTube の動画を撮って、自分を録画する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7144.07, "timestamp": "01:59:04", "text": "などなど。私は一度もアップロードしたことがないが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7146.55, "timestamp": "01:59:06", "text": "記録しました。どうやら私は2つ作ったようです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7149.43, "timestamp": "01:59:09", "text": "録音の別バージョン。 1つは普通の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7151.75, "timestamp": "01:59:11", "text": "私が話しているところなどをきちんと録音してください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7154.87, "timestamp": "01:59:14", "text": "などなど。一つは私ができないことです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7157.83, "timestamp": "01:59:17", "text": "まっすぐに言ってください。それはとても愚かで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7160.79, "timestamp": "01:59:20", "text": "奇妙で、しかもバカバカしい。私は文字通り"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7163.91, "timestamp": "01:59:23", "text": "子供、幼児の瞬間。えっと、PCを持っている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7166.07, "timestamp": "01:59:26", "text": "一瞬。ああ、あれは本当にバカげていた。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7168.07, "timestamp": "01:59:28", "text": "どうやら私がそれを自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7171.27, "timestamp": "01:59:31", "text": "いとこたちと母、ああ、恥ずかしい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7174.07, "timestamp": "01:59:34", "text": "物事が現れて、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7174.777, "timestamp": "01:59:34", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "JOQ THAT IS LITERALLY ME LMAOOO HAHAHHAA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7175.39, "timestamp": "01:59:35", "text": "泣いている"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7175.707, "timestamp": "01:59:35", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i had awkward moments. not really embarrassing moments 🤔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7178.39, "timestamp": "01:59:38", "text": "内部。いや、忘れてくれ。消去する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7181.